  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "For an **upper-upscale** positioning strategy in the Caribbean and Latin America, an owner should typically look at brands such as **Marriott**, **Sheraton**, **Westin**, **Delta Hotels**, **Hyatt Regency**, **Hyatt**, **Hilton**, **Embassy Suites**, **Curio Collection by Hilton**, and **Kimpton**. These are commonly mapped to the upper-upscale segment in hotel chain-scale guides, while brands like **Courtyard**, **Hyatt Place**, and **AC Hotels** are usually positioned lower, in the upscale segment rather than upper-upscale.[1][3]\n\nThe most relevant **upper-upscale brand families** to evaluate are:\n\n- **Marriott International**: Marriott, Sheraton, Westin, Delta Hotels, Le Méridien, Tribute Portfolio.[1][3]\n- **Hyatt**: Hyatt Regency, Hyatt, Hyatt Centric.[1][3]\n- **Hilton**: Hilton, Embassy Suites, Curio Collection by Hilton.[1]\n- **IHG**: Kimpton.[1]\n- **Wyndham**: Wyndham, Dolce.[1]\n\nFor the **Caribbean**, the market already shows strong luxury and upper-upscale demand in resort and leisure destinations, with active branded presence from companies such as Four Seasons, Hilton, Hyatt, and Marriott across places like Puerto Rico, Anguilla, Nevis, the Bahamas, and the Dominican Republic.[4][6][8] This suggests that if the asset is resort-oriented, brands with strong leisure and mixed resort-city appeal—especially **Hyatt Regency**, **Hilton**, **Marriott**, **Westin**, **Sheraton**, and **Curio Collection**—are the most natural candidates.[4][6][8]\n\nFor **Latin America**, the same upper-upscale flags usually work best where the hotel needs a blend of business, group, and premium leisure demand, so the most practical shortlist is often **Marriott**, **Sheraton**, **Westin**, **Hyatt Regency**, **Hilton**, and **Kimpton**.[1][3] If the property is more independent in character or design-led, **Curio Collection**, **Tribute Portfolio**, or **Kimpton** may fit better than a classic full-service flag.[1][3]\n\nIf you want, I can turn this into a **brand-by-brand shortlist for a specific country or city** in the Caribbean or Latin America.",
